Spoilers follow...

Pray: I use this to prevent starvation. When you are fainting, <p>ray and
your stomach will be filled. I think that there are several other uses of
pray. Essentially, use it in tight situations. (But don't pray too often!)

Selling items: <d>rop them.

Rings and sinks: Dropping a ring in a sink may give you a clue as to the
nature of the ring. However, you will almost certainly lose the ring.

Banks: On a level where there is a bank ("You hear someone counting
money."), there will be a secret door in one of the rooms. Engraved on the
floor before the door are the words "ad astra". Behind this door is a
teleport to the bank. The hard part is getting out again...

